  "_about": "How each recorded line is performed: ElevenLabs audio tags, put in front of the text sent to the voice (tools/audio/generate.mjs) when the speaker's model performs them (Eleven v3, v4 and later). Keyed by speaker, then by the line's exact text as the game shows it. Tags are never shown, never part of a manifest key and never change a file name. Usually one tag, at most two, chosen from the line's scene and mood, and never fighting the words. A new or changed line isn't done until it has its tag; test/audio.test.js checks.",
